            "customer_message_en": "I'll pass this to one of our senior stylists who can advise properly — they'll get back to you within about 30 minutes.",
            "agent_must_not": ["提供任何诊断", "推荐任何生发/药用产品", "判断脱发原因"]
          }
        }
      },
      "complaint": {
        "input": {
          "customer_id": "cus_1001",
